{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach, grab and move it to destination. Process its properties and perform specific task. Else, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
